    "waveform_policy": "45..55% duty and tr+tf <= 2T/3 are conditions of the vendor fmax definition. They are not established by has_cycle_timing_bounds, integer division, compile/link, or the 20MHz check. Board/receiver waveform suitability remains an explicit application qualification obligation.",
    "characterization": "Own A030 DS CN1.1 Table 7-26 (PDF page 48, printed page 47) calls the values design/simulation data, unmeasured. Primary authority is the own A030 datasheet plus the explicitly shared x030 RM CN2.5. The RM unnumbered cover PDF page 1 names CW32F030/CW32A030; locked page-text SHA256 is 7f55b61c0e816050f3215ea6d1346ad65bf055308d65483bf233f16e519333c6. The F030 SDK remains F030-only and is supplemental shared-IP corroboration, not an independent A030 SDK or A030 pin/electrical authority."
